+- `--threshold <metric>=<min>` – gate the evaluation on metric scores (can be repeated). Example: `--threshold exact_match=0.9 --threshold toxicity=0.95`. Exits 0 if all pass, 1 if any fail, 2 for validation errors. Valid metrics: `exact_match`, `toxicity`, `length_variance`.
 
